          "support": "At T=10^-6, compressible energy is dominated by phonons from vortex-antivortex annihilation; total phonon energy scales as tau_Q^{-(3*nu+1/2)/(1+z*nu)} and spectral density as tau_Q^{-(2*nu+1/2)/(1+z*nu)} * G(k*tau_Q^{nu/(1+z*nu)}); for mean-field exponents, E_c ~ tau_Q^{-1}, and E_c(k)*tau_Q^{3/4} collapses vs k*tau_Q^{1/4}"
        }
      ]
    }
